The mscx, MIDI and MusicXML files in this directory are copies of test
fixtures taken from the upstream MuseScore repository:

  https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore
  - Root fixtures (midi*, testArpeggio, testVolta*, testSingleNoteDynamics, …):
      src/importexport/midi/tests/midiexport_data/
  - musicxml/ subdirectory:
      src/importexport/musicxml/tests/data/
  - repeat52.mscx, repeat53.mscx:
      src/engraving/tests/repeat_data/
  - grace_after.mscx and slur_ms4_glissando_legato.mscx (upstream
    simple_glissando_legato.mscx):
      src/engraving/tests/midi/midirenderer_data/
  - guitarbend_{simple,prebend,slightbend,tied,gracebend}.mscx and
    guitarbend_release_twice.mscx (upstream bend_release_twice.mscx):
      src/engraving/tests/midi/midirenderer_bend_data/
  - single_note_multi_appoggiatura_post.mscx:
      src/engraving/tests/playback/playbackeventsrenderer_data/
      single_note_multi_appoggiatura_post/

They are reproduced here to allow the swift-sheet-music test suite to
verify equivalence of its MIDI export against MuseScore's own exporter
output, to exercise the MusicXML importer against MuseScore's own
MusicXML round-trip reference files, and — for the two grace fixtures —
to pin how MuseScore itself lays grace notes out in a file, which this
project's own round trip cannot observe.

These files are licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3
(GPL-3.0), the same licence as the upstream MuseScore source code:

  Copyright (C) 1999-2026 MuseScore Limited and others
  Licensed under GPL-3.0-only.

The full GPL-3.0 licence text is available at:
  https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
  https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore/blob/master/LICENSE.txt

Note: these fixtures are confined to the test target of this Swift
package. They are not part of any of the published library products
(`SheetMusic`, `SheetMusicCore`, `SheetMusicMSCX`, `SheetMusicMIDI`) and
are not redistributed when the package is consumed via SwiftPM.

The midi01.mscz fixture is simply a ZIP-archived copy of midi01.mscx —
same GPL-3.0 provenance, no additional content. Produced with:

    zip -qX9 midi01.mscz score.mscx

where score.mscx is a byte-identical copy of midi01.mscx renamed to
the default MuseScore main-file name.

---

MuseScore 3 fixtures (GPL-2.0)
------------------------------

Some fixtures are copies of MuseScore 3 test data, not MuseScore 4, and
are taken at tag v3.6.2 (https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore/tree/v3.6.2):

  - legacybend_ms3_canonical.mscx:
      mtest/libmscore/midi/testBends1.mscx
  - legacybend_ms3_play_and_beams.mscx:
      mtest/libmscore/midi/testBends2.mscx
  - slur_ms3_exchangevoices.mscx:
      mtest/libmscore/exchangevoices/exchangevoices-slurs.mscx

The first two pin how MuseScore 3 serializes the legacy `<Bend>`
element, which no MuseScore 4 fixture carries; the third pins how it
serializes chord-anchored slurs, including the cross-voice and
cross-barline `<location>` forms.

MuseScore 3 is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2,
not version 3, so the GPL-3.0 statement above does not cover these
files. Per LICENSE.GPL at that tag:

  Copyright (C) 1999-2020 MuseScore BVBA and others
  Licensed under GPL-2.0-only.

The full GPL-2.0 licence text is available at:
  https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt
  https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore/blob/v3.6.2/LICENSE.GPL

