MIT-licensed fixtures
---------------------

The following files are not copies of MuseScore's GPL fixtures. They
were hand-authored specifically for the swift-sheet-music test suite:

  multiPartMixedStaves.mscx
  harmony-basic.mscx
  staff-line-count.mscx
  legacybend_ms4_resave.mscx — hand-authored, but not from scratch: it
    was edited down from guitarbend_simple.mscx above (GuitarBend
    spanners removed, a legacy `<Bend>` inserted), so the GPL-3.0 terms
    also cover the MuseScore-authored skeleton it retains.
  slur_ms4_resave.mscx — hand-authored the same way, from
    legacybend_ms4_resave.mscx's skeleton (the `<Bend>` and its ties
    replaced by two chord-anchored slurs: one same-measure, one crossing
    the bar line), so the same GPL-3.0 remark applies transitively. It
    is written in this package's own writer dialect so it can serve as a
    byte-parity fixed point — the vendored slur_ms4_glissando_legato.mscx
    cannot, because it carries `<linkedMain/>` / `<linked>` part-linking
    tags, a tablature `<StaffType>` body and other MuseScore-4.2 fields
    this model does not hold.

These files are contributed under the same MIT license that applies to
`Sources/` in this repository. The full MIT license text is in the
`LICENSE` file at the repository root.

